const pagePhrases={
  zh:{'Under a week, June–August, first time in Mongolia.':'不到一周，六月至八月，第一次来蒙古。','Central Mongolia. Karakorum, the Orkhon Valley, Tovkhon Monastery, Tsenkher Hot Springs.':'蒙古中部：哈拉和林、鄂尔浑河谷、图布亨寺和青格尔温泉。','Two weeks, June–August, want the country wide.':'两周时间，六月至八月，想看看更广阔的蒙古。','The Gobi-and-Central 10-day combines the four landmark Gobi sites with the Central core in one loop.':'10 天戈壁与中部环线，将戈壁四大景点与蒙古中部精华串联起来。','Twelve to twenty days, summer, drawn to the reindeer culture.':'夏季有 12 至 20 天，想了解驯鹿文化。','The 12-day Tsaatan trip rides three days into the Darkhad Valley to live with reindeer-herding families.':'12 天查坦之旅骑行三天深入达尔哈德山谷，与驯鹿牧民家庭共同生活。','Early October, want the Golden Eagle Festival.':'十月初，想参加金鹰节。','July 11-13, want Naadam.':'七月 11 至 13 日，想看那达慕。','A weekend out of Ulaanbaatar.':'从乌兰巴托出发的周末短途旅行。','Two weeks or more, summer, want the Altai.':'夏季有两周或更久，想去阿尔泰。','Talk to Baska.':'联系巴斯卡。','Baska designs.':'巴斯卡设计路线。','We confirm and schedule.':'确认行程并安排出发。','Buya leads on the road.':'布雅带队出行。','When to come':'何时出发','What to bring':'需要携带什么','On the road':'旅途生活','A Mongolian team':'蒙古本地团队','A month across Mongolia gave us some of the most extraordinary experiences of our lives. The landscapes, the people and the quiet nights in a ger were unforgettable.':'一个月的蒙古之旅带给我们人生中最难忘的体验。壮丽风景、热情的人们和蒙古包里的宁静夜晚令人难忘。','Buya found meat-free meals for me every day, made wonderful coffee, and was a safe, thoughtful guide. Baska checked in throughout.':'布雅每天都为我准备素食，咖啡也很棒。他驾驶稳妥、体贴周到，巴斯卡一路关心我们的情况。','They tailored the route to our dates and we saw so much of the country without a single hitch. I’ll be back.':'他们按我们的日期定制行程，让我们顺利看到了很多地方。我还会再来。'},
  ru:{'Under a week, June–August, first time in Mongolia.':'Меньше недели, июнь–август, первая поездка в Монголию.','Central Mongolia. Karakorum, the Orkhon Valley, Tovkhon Monastery, Tsenkher Hot Springs.':'Центральная Монголия: Каракорум, долина Орхона, монастырь Тувхен и источники Цэнхэр.','Two weeks, June–August, want the country wide.':'Две недели летом, хочется увидеть страну целиком.','The Gobi-and-Central 10-day combines the four landmark Gobi sites with the Central core in one loop.':'Десятидневный маршрут по Гоби и центру объединяет четыре главные достопримечательности Гоби и центральные земли.','Twelve to twenty days, summer, drawn to the reindeer culture.':'От 12 до 20 дней летом, интересует культура оленеводов.','The 12-day Tsaatan trip rides three days into the Darkhad Valley to live with reindeer-herding families.':'В 12-дневном путешествии к цаатанам три дня едут верхом в долину Дархад, чтобы пожить у оленеводов.','Early October, want the Golden Eagle Festival.':'Начало октября, хочется попасть на фестиваль беркутов.','July 11-13, want Naadam.':'11–13 июля, хочется увидеть Наадам.','A weekend out of Ulaanbaatar.':'Выходные за пределами Улан-Батора.','Two weeks or more, summer, want the Altai.':'Две недели или больше летом, хочется увидеть Алтай.','Talk to Baska.':'Поговорите с Баской.','Baska designs.':'Баска разрабатывает маршрут.','We confirm and schedule.':'Подтверждаем и назначаем даты.','Buya leads on the road.':'Буя ведёт поездку.','When to come':'Когда приезжать','What to bring':'Что взять с собой','On the road':'В дороге','A Mongolian team':'Монгольская команда','A month across Mongolia gave us some of the most extraordinary experiences of our lives. The landscapes, the people and the quiet nights in a ger were unforgettable.':'Месяц в Монголии подарил нам одни из самых ярких впечатлений в жизни. Пейзажи, люди и тихие ночи в гэре незабываемы.','Buya found meat-free meals for me every day, made wonderful coffee, and was a safe, thoughtful guide. Baska checked in throughout.':'Буя каждый день находил для меня блюда без мяса, готовил отличный кофе и был внимательным и надёжным гидом. Баска регулярно интересовалась, всё ли хорошо.','They tailored the route to our dates and we saw so much of the country without a single hitch. I’ll be back.':'Они составили маршрут под наши даты, и мы без проблем увидели столько всего. Я обязательно вернусь.'},
  th:{'Under a week, June–August, first time in Mongolia.':'ไม่เกินหนึ่งสัปดาห์ ช่วงมิถุนายน–สิงหาคม มาเที่ยวมองโกเลียครั้งแรก','Central Mongolia. Karakorum, the Orkhon Valley, Tovkhon Monastery, Tsenkher Hot Springs.':'มองโกเลียตอนกลาง: คาราโครัม หุบเขาออร์คอน อารามโตฟคอน และบ่อน้ำพุร้อนเซนเคอร์','Two weeks, June–August, want the country wide.':'สองสัปดาห์ ช่วงมิถุนายน–สิงหาคม อยากเที่ยวให้ทั่วประเทศ','The Gobi-and-Central 10-day combines the four landmark Gobi sites with the Central core in one loop.':'ทริปโกบีและตอนกลาง 10 วัน รวมสถานที่สำคัญสี่แห่งของโกบีและไฮไลต์ตอนกลางไว้ในเส้นทางเดียว','Twelve to twenty days, summer, drawn to the reindeer culture.':'ช่วงฤดูร้อน 12–20 วัน สนใจวัฒนธรรมการเลี้ยงกวางเรนเดียร์','The 12-day Tsaatan trip rides three days into the Darkhad Valley to live with reindeer-herding families.':'ทริปซาตัน 12 วัน ขี่ม้าสามวันสู่หุบเขาดาร์คฮัดเพื่อพักกับครอบครัวผู้เลี้ยงกวางเรนเดียร์','Early October, want the Golden Eagle Festival.':'ต้นเดือนตุลาคม อยากชมเทศกาลอินทรีทอง','July 11-13, want Naadam.':'11–13 กรกฎาคม อยากชมเทศกาลนาดัม','A weekend out of Ulaanbaatar.':'ทริปสุดสัปดาห์จากอูลานบาตอร์','Two weeks or more, summer, want the Altai.':'ฤดูร้อนสองสัปดาห์ขึ้นไป อยากไปอัลไต','Talk to Baska.':'คุยกับบาสกา','Baska designs.':'บาสกาออกแบบเส้นทาง','We confirm and schedule.':'ยืนยันและจัดตาราง','Buya leads on the road.':'บูยานำทริป','When to come':'ช่วงเวลาที่ควรมา','What to bring':'สิ่งที่ควรนำไป','On the road':'ระหว่างเดินทาง','A Mongolian team':'ทีมชาวมองโกเลีย'},
  'pt-BR':{'Under a week, June–August, first time in Mongolia.':'Menos de uma semana, de junho a agosto, primeira viagem à Mongólia.','Central Mongolia. Karakorum, the Orkhon Valley, Tovkhon Monastery, Tsenkher Hot Springs.':'Mongólia Central: Karakorum, vale do Orkhon, mosteiro Tövkhön e fontes termais de Tsenkher.','Two weeks, June–August, want the country wide.':'Duas semanas, de junho a agosto, para conhecer o país.','The Gobi-and-Central 10-day combines the four landmark Gobi sites with the Central core in one loop.':'O roteiro de 10 dias pelo Gobi e pela região Central combina quatro atrações do deserto em um único circuito.','Twelve to twenty days, summer, drawn to the reindeer culture.':'De 12 a 20 dias no verão, com interesse pela cultura das renas.','The 12-day Tsaatan trip rides three days into the Darkhad Valley to live with reindeer-herding families.':'A viagem de 12 dias aos Tsaatan inclui três dias a cavalo pelo vale Darkhad e hospedagem com famílias criadoras de renas.','Early October, want the Golden Eagle Festival.':'Início de outubro, para conhecer o Festival da Águia Dourada.','July 11-13, want Naadam.':'De 11 a 13 de julho, para ver o Naadam.','A weekend out of Ulaanbaatar.':'Um fim de semana fora de Ulaanbaatar.','Two weeks or more, summer, want the Altai.':'Duas semanas ou mais no verão, para conhecer o Altai.','Talk to Baska.':'Converse com Baska.','Baska designs.':'Baska cria o roteiro.','We confirm and schedule.':'Confirmamos e organizamos as datas.','Buya leads on the road.':'Buya conduz a viagem.','When to come':'Quando viajar','What to bring':'O que levar','On the road':'Na estrada','A Mongolian team':'Uma equipe mongol'},
  fr:{'Under a week, June–August, first time in Mongolia.':'Moins d’une semaine, de juin à août, premier voyage en Mongolie.','Central Mongolia. Karakorum, the Orkhon Valley, Tovkhon Monastery, Tsenkher Hot Springs.':'Mongolie centrale : Karakorum, vallée de l’Orkhon, monastère de Tövkhön et sources chaudes de Tsenkher.','Two weeks, June–August, want the country wide.':'Deux semaines en été pour découvrir le pays.','The Gobi-and-Central 10-day combines the four landmark Gobi sites with the Central core in one loop.':'Le circuit de dix jours dans le Gobi et le centre réunit quatre sites emblématiques du désert et les incontournables du centre.','Twelve to twenty days, summer, drawn to the reindeer culture.':'De douze à vingt jours en été, pour découvrir la culture des éleveurs de rennes.','The 12-day Tsaatan trip rides three days into the Darkhad Valley to live with reindeer-herding families.':'Le voyage de douze jours chez les Tsaatan comprend trois jours à cheval dans la vallée de Darkhad et un séjour chez des éleveurs de rennes.','Early October, want the Golden Eagle Festival.':'Début octobre, pour assister au festival des aigliers.','July 11-13, want Naadam.':'Du 11 au 13 juillet, pour le Naadam.','A weekend out of Ulaanbaatar.':'Un week-end au départ d’Oulan-Bator.','Two weeks or more, summer, want the Altai.':'Deux semaines ou plus en été, pour découvrir l’Altaï.','Talk to Baska.':'Parler à Baska.','Baska designs.':'Baska conçoit le parcours.','We confirm and schedule.':'Nous confirmons les dates.','Buya leads on the road.':'Buya vous accompagne.','When to come':'Quand venir','What to bring':'Que mettre dans ses bagages','On the road':'Sur la route','A Mongolian team':'Une équipe mongole'},
  it:{'Under a week, June–August, first time in Mongolia.':'Meno di una settimana, da giugno ad agosto, primo viaggio in Mongolia.','Central Mongolia. Karakorum, the Orkhon Valley, Tovkhon Monastery, Tsenkher Hot Springs.':'Mongolia centrale: Karakorum, valle dell’Orkhon, monastero di Tövkhön e sorgenti termali di Tsenkher.','Two weeks, June–August, want the country wide.':'Due settimane in estate per scoprire il paese.','The Gobi-and-Central 10-day combines the four landmark Gobi sites with the Central core in one loop.':'Il tour di dieci giorni tra Gobi e Mongolia centrale unisce quattro luoghi simbolo del deserto ai punti salienti della regione centrale.','Twelve to twenty days, summer, drawn to the reindeer culture.':'Da dodici a venti giorni in estate, per conoscere la cultura delle renne.','The 12-day Tsaatan trip rides three days into the Darkhad Valley to live with reindeer-herding families.':'Il viaggio di dodici giorni dagli Tsaatan include tre giorni a cavallo nella valle del Darkhad e un soggiorno con famiglie che allevano renne.','Early October, want the Golden Eagle Festival.':'Inizio ottobre, per il Festival delle aquile.','July 11-13, want Naadam.':'Dall’11 al 13 luglio, per il Naadam.','A weekend out of Ulaanbaatar.':'Un fine settimana fuori da Ulaanbaatar.','Two weeks or more, summer, want the Altai.':'Due settimane o più in estate, per visitare l’Altai.','Talk to Baska.':'Parla con Baska.','Baska designs.':'Baska progetta il percorso.','We confirm and schedule.':'Confermiamo e fissiamo le date.','Buya leads on the road.':'Buya guida il viaggio.','When to come':'Quando partire','What to bring':'Cosa portare','On the road':'In viaggio','A Mongolian team':'Un team mongolo'}
};
